{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a1caf81b7a3839d444aedcf12187b925a587e755787c4935983229a63190bea8", "ja": "夜について", "zh": "关于夜晚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "31473f25d252ac572bdd0b0e0a43f72d6d8be6537abe571a168209ee35f7acdb", "ja": "今回『FantasticLight』公演のテーマ\nは『夜』。レッスンの休憩中や帰り際、テー\nマについて熱心に話し合うアイドル達。やが\nておぼろげながら、楽しく過ごす夜のイメー\nジが固まっていく。", "zh": "本次《FantasticLight》公演的主题\n是“夜”。偶像们在课程休息时和离开时，热\n烈地讨论着主题。渐渐地，愉快度过夜晚的\n印象也开始逐渐成形。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2b069af3f6da69a57a561f50db951c028d8a047b8e591c01b45b578806d81f2", "ja": "（ツアー公演に向けたレッスンの休憩中。\nみんな、おしゃべりに花が咲いているようだ……）", "zh": "（为巡演公演练习的休息时间。大家似乎聊得正起劲……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "e7e8cf25fc8cddfe7995074d7bfa988e5aef9544b3cd0bcd94705952e6806559", "ja": "ついに、ツアーの締めくくりですね。\n責任重大ですよね！　気合い入れなきゃ……。", "zh": "终于要迎来巡演的收官演出了呢。\n责任重大啊！得打起精神才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "feab9d69aca20bdeb2f00f82a368481a86bf31f6838f22a1d5f5445cb84af9b6", "ja": "んだねー！　アタシたち、ファンタスティックナイト\nだっけ？　ちょーアガるネーミングだよね♪", "zh": "是啊——！我们是“Fantastic Night”来着？这名字也太让人兴奋了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7686d8949b538cc25c9fca253a5cdb3e736e4264bc4d35a5662cb172fe1abacf", "ja": "惜しい、ライトな。『FantasticLight』。", "zh": "差一点，是Light。叫作“FantasticLight”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "a1a357212387bd046658758c83c95988a9c142894231543ef00e994cca42f9fe", "ja": "でもテーマは夜なんでしょ？　ウフフ♪\n私にぴったりよね～、セクシー満載で行きましょっ！", "zh": "不过主题是夜晚，对吧？呵呵♪  \n正适合我呢～那就尽情展现性感吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "776bd111f692e7c4dac1064551da06d19eb4e478e3f262ca1d62788719e9d0d2", "ja": "えっ……あ、あの、夜ってセクシーだけじゃないと\n思うんです！　星のきらめきとか、そういう……。", "zh": "诶……那、那个，我觉得夜晚不只有性感这一面！\n还有星星的闪耀之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "7f2341d5ae4d1588f24ad44c5f19ef6263df9b6253b3b8e9bfb5f7fae0919e50", "ja": "じ、自信がないわけじゃないですよ！？\n{$P$}、勘違いしないでくださいね。", "zh": "我、我并不是没有自信哦！？{$P$}，您可别误会了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9167554587e143f9d7f8186cf2b9d667148ece910d085ffd603730ee6aa56f99", "ja": "いや、何も言ってないけど……\nまあ、方向性を決めてしまうのはまだ早いかもな。", "zh": "不，我也没说什么啊……\n不过，现在就定下方向性可能确实还太早了点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "54931d8e130f940e6e123804906d048a1166abaa5b9ad38cf6abc8adee43138c", "ja": "平気よ？　私、キラキラした夜も好きだし♪\nでも都会だと、なかなか星って見えにくいわよね～。", "zh": "没事的哦？我也挺喜欢闪闪发光的夜晚呢♪\n不过在都市里，往往很难看得到星星呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "4165258e070196d483a7de843debcbf9c1991019ff4d84c22505959137a2a3b4", "ja": "うん……町の光が強いから、隠れちゃうんだって。\nちょっとさみしいよね……。", "zh": "嗯……听说是因为城里的灯光太亮，星星就被遮住了。\n稍微有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "068d887bc7b8ad2e4a52b4e5419e62db591ed87fe4a3056913255cd94014c25c", "ja": "でもアタシは、町の明かりも嫌いじゃないけどな～。\nにぎやかなのは好きだしね♪　にゃはは。", "zh": "不过我也不讨厌城里的灯光啦～。\n我喜欢热闹嘛♪　呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "a20e393fc3762352956190e2ba08654876e7a524500ceadda9cbf76d2bc9eb14", "ja": "それにさ、家の窓の明かりって、\nなんかあったかくて、ホッとしない？", "zh": "而且啊，家家户户窗户里透出的灯光，\n总让人觉得暖洋洋的，不是会让人放松下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "cc7262cae483a2c20e6aca919fcd2a2bd3c1b8877866ad49ab0e01228ef93c20", "ja": "あ、わかるかも。わたし達が生きているしょうこだし。\nそっか……町の明かりも、夜の光なんだね！", "zh": "啊，我好像明白了。也是我们活着的证明嘛。\n这样啊……城镇的灯光也是夜晚的光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "ddd8e2bac5444f8f3b57ef0f182253164aa0122ff601918fcd8d466b728725fb", "ja": "育ってたまに、小学生っぽくないよね～……。\nでもまあ、そんなとこ。色んな光があっていいじゃん♪", "zh": "育有时候真不像个小学生呢～……不过，大概就是那么回事吧。有各种各样的光不也挺好的吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "484085864f89698ae4a3abd4f65e3cb2d538ae3c9037f2582f418d0f4eed2032", "ja": "なるほど……夜を照らす、たくさんの光。\n何となく、公演のイメージが掴めたかも知れません！", "zh": "原来如此……照亮夜晚的众多光芒。\n我好像有点抓住公演的感觉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b140ae2413573c243092f6ee7d295301d339cc1abd406a8fee69cd8ebcbed868", "ja": "（何気ない雑談の中から、ヒントを掴んでいく……\nこのモチベーションの高さは頼もしいな）", "zh": "（她能从不经意的闲聊中抓住提示……这股高涨的干劲真让人放心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "509ffd2ac55ea6a37c9f1971eab079bb5097000551d03481572aa029dab9aeeb", "ja": "（レッスン後。遅くなってしまったので、\nみんなを送っていくことになった……）", "zh": "（练习结束后，因为时间已经很晚了，便决定送大家回去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef929b697d1a42353a904b0567268b53d013b68eb036ea6b5305f0ce02addb4a", "ja": "夜になると、この辺りは静かですね。\n町の音が遠くて、風の音が大きいように感じます。", "zh": "一到晚上，这一带就格外安静呢。\n街市的声音很遥远，感觉风声都变大了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3d2b99f57e59c5e2be06ee66d554cec3d1bdeeea3b95384a0e5e96d44587dd63", "ja": "そうですね。繁華街からは少し離れてますし。", "zh": "是啊，这里离繁华街还有一段距离。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "e301c918ff3481bee85a9ec7a1bc6ebb6305c62530d897700e2b7107e47d6911", "ja": "なんだか心が落ち着きます。\nでも、少しだけ寂しく思えるような……。", "zh": "总觉得心情平静下来了。\n不过，好像又觉得有一点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "be7204287d3c874b5c8dd1b8b9ebbebf53a0a4bf140af3551ed818ad5abf8f20", "ja": "歌織さーんっ、聞いてくださいよ！\n亜美が私のヤキニクマンシールとったんですよー！", "zh": "歌织姐——！听我说呀！亚美把我的烤肉超人贴纸拿走了啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "27a020100ccb2d9e09ddbf682af7fd468717532743e22190ba252ecd592930ad", "ja": "とってないよー！　トレードで、\n亜美も出したじゃん！　おあいこだよ～！", "zh": "我才没拿啦——！是交换来的，\n你不也拿出来了吗！这下扯平了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "8d65f20d6cccc3f9a441736fda0151c3ca458d024aaf54e2ac57d4b3a928b597", "ja": "私のはキラキラで、亜美のはノーマルじゃん！\nぜったい不公平だよー！", "zh": "我的可是闪卡，亚美的是普通卡嘛！绝对不公平啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee88a1132207fd393730440c9120f024ca2d2fb74787221542f3145302165b3a", "ja": "やれやれ、ここは茜ちゃんシールの出番かにゃ？\nほらほら、これをあげるから仲良くしたまえ！", "zh": "真是的，这下该轮到小茜贴纸登场了喵？  \n来来，这个给你们，和睦相处吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd892251433ddf71970a698078ef503184681ecdbac025bca148d25da4b9742f", "ja": "いや、それは今いいかな。", "zh": "不了，这个就先不用了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "fb2c2c2a917c1da392b2edfa6ef2719dec2a4b10a4dc88665872a78899801a96", "ja": "うん。いいかな……。", "zh": "嗯。先算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e41e63fac4c263dfacc87e36a0bba74d2c0381a4d373187361069731bc7d9db", "ja": "ギニャーッ！？", "zh": "喵哇——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "2bf16c0f5458ca2115c24637821128b970f0dcc6cabb5edc8f2edb792459a730", "ja": "まあ……ふ、ふふっ！　あははっ。", "zh": "嗯……呵、呵呵！啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ef48a1b4032d5bad0f1b826f37dd8b9cc455ea2173c66599ea480d3b3f82bc1b", "ja": "歌織さん？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "歌织？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "ccc73221a1328b3b6a094c7c70d43a6f2e1b9afa390ed9dab7cfb2c77ec76d21", "ja": "いえ。やっぱり私たちには、静かで寂しい夜より、\n楽しい夜が似合いますよね♪　ふふっ。", "zh": "没什么。果然比起安静寂寞的夜晚，\n还是热闹开心的夜晚更适合我们呢♪　呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ee7eb3efa7ecf900cceb08de9ec47abadfa65e0dccb4f534e0559e21d296e4db", "ja": "（何か気付きがあったみたいだ。\nきっと、深みのあるステージになるだろうな！）", "zh": "（好像有所领悟。一定会呈现出一场内涵深刻的舞台表演吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
